Part D of references/tells.md, the rewrite rules in SKILL.md and some scanner
rules adapt pattern ideas from two further MIT-licensed skills. Their text was
not copied: every entry and example was written fresh for this fork. Their
notices are reproduced here so the credit travels with the archive.

https://github.com/blader/humanizer (commit 0ef9fe5)

